  "text": "MedlinePlus Consumer Guide to Digestive Health and Self-Care | Publisher: US National Libr\nManaging Gas and Bloating\nOccasional intestinal gas is normal. Self-Care for Mild Bloating: - Avoid\nchewing gum or drinking through straws, which increases swallowed air. -\nLimit carbonated beverages. - Engage in light walking after meals to\nencourage gas clearance.\nPage 2 of 4 | Official Educational Resource",
